Captain Candy, let's fight back with our own Combine Operation!

00:15:58.160 --> 00:16:01.470
Huh? Oh, not a bad idea-kuru!

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:03.100
What idea-da wasa?

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:05.860
Just leave it to Captain Candy-kuru!

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:09.790
Let's Go: Angel!

00:16:09.770 --> 00:16:11.080
A Décor?!

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:13.440
Oh, I get it! Cool!

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:15.840
Happy Jet!

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:21.020
Tremble in fear, villains! Happy Robo shall be your undoing!

00:16:22.220 --> 00:16:24.510
Maybe we should quit infighting, huh?

00:16:24.510 --> 00:16:25.820
Yeah, I guess-oni.

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:28.690
Hyper!

00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:30.400
Here we come!

00:16:30.400 --> 00:16:32.680
Go get them-da wasa!

00:16:30.400 --> 00:16:32.680
You can do it-kuru!

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:34.430
Let's do this, Happy Robo!

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:35.430
Okay!

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:36.640
To battle!

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:40.470
Happy Punch!

00:16:41.070 --> 00:16:42.420
Alright!

00:16:44.840 --> 00:16:47.180
You brats...!

00:16:47.180 --> 00:16:48.880
Happy Jet!

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:50.920
Get back here!

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:54.300
Meanie Master Dark Thunder!

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:59.920
Now it's my turn-oni! Meanie Master Beam!

00:16:59.920 --> 00:17:01.400
Happy Barrier!

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:05.480
Did we get her?!

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:06.300
I think we did-oni!

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:09.430
Your attacks won't pierce our Happy Barrier!

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:11.240
What?!

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:14.210
Happy Kick!

00:17:19.480 --> 00:17:21.680
I'm so cool now!

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:24.420
Yay! Happy Robo's invincible-kuru!

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:26.440
This isn't looking good...

00:17:27.220 --> 00:17:28.840
Dang it, Akaoni!

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:31.190
It's not my fault! You should pilot better!

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:34.360
Okay, let's finish this with the Ultra Happy Punch!

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:38.210
Our finisher, I presume? That was on Page 583, as I recall.

00:17:38.210 --> 00:17:39.560
You read all that?!

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:42.720
Happy Energy, Full Power!

00:17:43.470 --> 00:17:45.440
Let's finish this!

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:48.010
Ultra Happy Punch!

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:49.780
My hand! You fired off my hand!

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:53.580
Akan...?

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:54.850
Wha—?!

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:05.800
Ouchie... hey, my hand's back!

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:12.700
Hmph! If I couldn't use it again anyway, I should have just busted it straight away-da wasa!

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:14.280
No way...

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:20.380
Happy Robo isn't meant to lose like this...

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:25.480
Hyper Akanbe!

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:28.440
Guess this changes things, Precure!

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:31.380
Looks like this is gonna be the end for you-oni!

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:38.080
Time to crush the lot of you!

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:45.360
Don't worry, Peace!

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:51.240
"We can't let these fiends rob Earth of its smiles! 
So no matter what happens, we stand tall, together!"

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:52.300
Right?

00:18:54.140 --> 00:18:56.620
<i>We can't let these fiends rob Earth of its smiles!</i>

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:59.980
<i>So no matter what happens, we stand tall, together!</i>

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:02.720
<i>You got that right, Robotter!</i>

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:04.400
<i>Let's finish this the way we always do!</i>

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:06.040
<i>Indeed!</i>

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:12.940
You've got that right, Happy...

00:19:14.360 --> 00:19:16.190
Let's finish this, the way we always do!

00:19:16.190 --> 00:19:17.400
Right!

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:24.160
Pegasus, grant us your power!

00:19:38.700 --> 00:19:40.890
Princess Happy!

00:19:40.890 --> 00:19:43.090
Princess Sunny!

00:19:43.090 --> 00:19:45.290
Princess Peace!

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:47.490
Princess March!

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:49.690
Princess Beauty!

00:19:53.680 --> 00:19:57.620
Precure: Princess Form!

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:05.320
Reveal your secrets, Royal Clock!

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:09.540
Combine our powers together-kuru!

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:24.440
May the light of hope shine!

00:20:25.420 --> 00:20:29.120
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:35.480
Precure...

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:39.520
Royal Rainbow...

00:20:39.520 --> 00:20:42.280
Burst!

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:50.580
Akanbe...!

00:20:54.840 --> 00:20:58.900
Shine, Happy Smiles!

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:10.710
You did well out there, men-kuru!

00:21:10.710 --> 00:21:12.880
Dang you all, Precure!

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:15.000
We'll get you next time-oni! {Next time, Gadget. Next time.}

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:16.880
You'll pay for this-da wasa!

00:21:22.850 --> 00:21:24.320
Yay!

00:21:25.820 --> 00:21:28.260
It's good to see everyone smiling again!

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:31.500
Guess these robots of yours ain't just machines after all.

00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:36.100
Quite. They have the power to bring smiles to the hearts of children.

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:41.070
And they give you the courage to pull through the worst of times! Hard to fault that, really.

00:21:41.350 --> 00:21:42.320
Guys...

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:44.510
Happy Robo was really tough back there-kuru!

00:21:44.510 --> 00:21:46.480
We should do that again some time, Miyuki-chan!

00:21:47.550 --> 00:21:51.580
Oh, don't look at me like that! I'll make sure I pilot you properly next time!

00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:54.140
That's not the problem here!

00:21:56.120 --> 00:21:58.180
Iron Warrior Robotter!

00:21:58.180 --> 00:22:01.140
You gave me the courage I needed to face up to anything!

00:22:01.140 --> 00:22:03.900
You're my hero!

00:23:39.540 --> 00:23:41.940
<i>Hello! My name is Akane!</i>

00:23:41.940 --> 00:23:42.740
Umm, Akane?

00:23:42.740 --> 00:23:43.720
What's the matter?

00:23:43.720 --> 00:23:45.400
The exchange student rubbing off on you?

00:23:45.400 --> 00:23:48.160
Yeah! Brian's one super funny guy!

00:23:48.160 --> 00:23:50.920
Do you... <i>like</i> Brian, Akane?

00:23:51.780 --> 00:23:54.260
Don't be ridiculous! I don't feel anything for him!

00:23:54.260 --> 00:23:56.720
Hey, that ain't the Akane we know!

00:23:56.720 --> 00:23:57.890
Kuru?

00:23:57.890 --> 00:23:59.430
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.300 --> 00:24:04.640
Find your ultra happy smile!
